WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
The compute chip and memory arrive separately.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
An interposer is a base inside the package that holds and connects the two parts.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
A signal follows the trace between the two parts.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
A base can carry signals between several parts.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
A bridge connects nearby edges in a small area.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
Stacking the pieces lets connections run vertically.
